              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "എന്നെങ്കിലും (enneṅkiluṁ) is native Dravidian: ennu, \"what day\", from the question stem (DEDR 5151), then a conditional form of the verb \"to say\" meaning \"if\" (DEDR 868), and -uṁ: \"on whatever day it may be\"."
